{"title":"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/e/a2e21638b695dcaedf9d9c45cd0f45df2f1810df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{1}{b}+\\frac{1}{c}=\\frac{1}{2005}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"151\" height=\"38\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are different four-digit positive integers (natural numbers) and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is a five-digit positive integer (natural number).  What is the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>The following solution is non-rigorous</i>.</dd></dl>\n<p>Consider the easier question <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/a/c9a370f8759d2dae0a754b3879fec43868783c4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{a} + \\frac{1}{b} + \\frac{1}{c} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"116\" height=\"37\" />. The solution with unique values is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff52d1548440564ba712fabdecbe123975555ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2, b = 3, c = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"141\" height=\"16\" />. If we use this format to guess for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> in the problem, then we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/3/3c31a17940fd6c391cd90f2d9188475a60b11ba3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2 \\cdot 2005, b = 3 \\cdot 2005, c = 6 \\cdot 2005 = 12030$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"358\" height=\"16\" />. These fit the conditions, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/c/24c2939d1538b0ff2cd8dc93be8a880f7fc00f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12030$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>There are also another solution, if we multiply (10+4+2)/16 to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/5/fc5f1013409c2d3892933bb92367389e015e6a94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2005}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"38\" height=\"37\" /> we get 1/8020 + 1/3208 + 1/16040 = 1/2005\n</p><p>So c = 16040\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC\" title=\"2005 PMWC\">2005 PMWC </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I1\">Problem I1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I3\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I3\">Problem I3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">I: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I3\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I4\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I8\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I9\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I10\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I11\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I11\">11</a> <b>•<